ss (made on the first use; the proxy holds ob_refcnt 1 and ob_type 0"] [124 1 "// until the C API's types are given, 244-3 (a)'s next part)."] [137 35 "// ob_type: its type's handle"] [141 1 "// fromHandle is the object a PyObject * names (nil for NULL or an address that is no proxy)."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[48 36] [62 28] [65 30] [69 27] [129 25]]} (go/file "world.go" :imports [

